WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.463
"Acid Reflux Medicine
May Cause Osteoporosis"

00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:08.760
Nearly one in five adults
in the world

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.560
may have osteoporosis.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.540
That's hundreds of millions
of people.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.400
The word "osteoporosis"
literally means "porous bone."

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.560
Now, most of our bone

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.060
is actually porous
to begin with.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.580
This is what normal bone
looks like inside,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.760
but this is osteoporosis.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.000
Bone mineral density
is considered to be

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.180
the standard measure for
the diagnosis of osteoporosis.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.400
Although the bone mineral
density cut-off

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.220
for an osteoporosis diagnosis
is kind of arbitrary,

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.780
using the standard definition,

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:44.340
osteoporosis may affect
about 1 in 10 women by age 60,

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.440
2 in 10 by age 70,

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.000
4 in 10 by age 80,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.360
and 6 or 7 out of 10 by age 90.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.060
Osteoporosis
is typically thought of

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.020
as a disease in women,

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:58.440
but one third of hip fractures
occur in men.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.140
The lifetime risk
for osteoporotic fractures

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.840
for 50-year-old
white women and men

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.680
are 40 percent and 13 percent,
respectively.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.360
The good news is that
osteoporosis need not occur.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:15.600
Based on a study of the largest
twin registry in the world,

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.860
less than 30 percent

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.620
of osteoporotic fracture risk
is heritable,

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.540
leading the researchers
to conclude,

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:24.780
"Prevention of fractures
[even] in the oldest elderly

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.300
should focus on
lifestyle interventions."

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:31.020
This is consistent with
the enormous variation

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.760
of hip fracture rates
around the world,

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:35.640
with the incidence
of hip fracture varying 10-fold,

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:38.220
or even 100-fold
between countries,

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:40.440
suggesting that
excessive bone loss

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.980
is not just an inevitable
consequence of aging.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.400
The United States
Preventive Services Task Force,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.700
an independent scientific panel
that sets evidence-based,

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.020
clinical prevention guidelines,

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.240
recommends
osteoporosis screening,

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.760
such as DEXA
bone mineral density scan,

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.400
for all women
aged 65 years and older,

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.220
and potentially starting
even earlier than 65

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.020
for women at increased risk,

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.480
such as having
a parental history

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.280
of hip fracture, being a smoker

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.960
or an excessive
alcohol consumer,

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.280
or having low body weight.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.520
What should you do
if you're diagnosed?

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:15.840
Or more importantly,

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:19.680
what should you do
to never be diagnosed?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.200
Before exploring
the drugs on offering

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.700
to treat osteoporosis,

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.280
there are some drugs
that may cause it,

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.720
so let's start there.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.040
Stomach acid-blocking
"proton pump inhibitor" drugs,

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.300
so-called PPIs,

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.660
with brand names like Prilosec,
Prevacid, Nexium,

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.280
Protonix, and AcipHex,

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.800
are among the most popular drugs
in the world,

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.960
raking in
billions of dollars a year.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.240
But then in 2006,

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.580
two observational studies
out of Europe

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.580
suggested an association between
intake of this class of drugs

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.920
and increased risk
of hip fracture,

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.260
and by 2010,
the growing evidence

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:57.300
forced the U.S.
Food and Drug Administration

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.660
to issue a safety alert
implicating PPI use

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.480
with fractures of the hip,
wrist, and spine.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.320
By now, there's been
dozens such studies

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.880
involving more than
two million people

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.340
that, overall,
show higher hip fracture rates

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.320
among both long-
and short-term users

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.500
at all dose levels.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.100
The irony is that most people
taking these drugs

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.620
shouldn't even be on them
in the first place.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:26.280
These PPIs are only FDA-approved
for 10 days of use

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.580
for the treatment of H. pylori,
up to two weeks for heartburn,

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.040
up to eight weeks
for acid reflux disease,

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.440
and for two to six months
for ulcers.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.020
Yet, in a community survey,

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.000
most users
remained on these drugs

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.020
for more than a year,

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.900
and more than 60 percent
of patients were taking them

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.400
for inappropriate reasons,

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:48.180
often wrongly prescribed
for "indigestion,"

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:48.900
for instance.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.140
Calls to stop
this massive overuse

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.160
from regulatory authorities
have fallen on deaf doctor ears.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.560
And now that they're available
over the counter,

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.200
the problem of overuse
may have just gotten even worse.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.840
They can be hard to stop taking

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.840
since many patients
experience withdrawal symptoms

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.460
that can last for weeks.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.640
In fact, if you take normal,
healthy volunteers

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.600
without any symptoms

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.880
and put them on these drugs
for two months,

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.460
and then covertly
switch them to a placebo

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.260
without their knowledge,
all of a sudden,

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:21.420
they can develop
acid-related symptoms,

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.060
such as heartburn
or acid regurgitation,

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.400
so ending up worse off
than they were

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:28.680
before they even started
taking the drugs.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.220
In addition to bone fractures,
this class of drugs

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.840
has also been linked
to increased risk

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.660
of other possible
long-term adverse effects,

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.640
such as pneumonia,

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.520
intestinal infections,

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:43.920
kidney failure,

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.080
stomach cancer,

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.260
and cardiovascular disease.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.240
In fact,
the blood vessel effects

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:52.260
could explain the case report

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:55.560
"Abrupt-Onset,
Profound Erectile Dysfunction

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.480
in a Healthy Young Man
After Initiating

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.980
Over-the-Counter Prilosec."

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:01.740
Oh, and also,

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.780
premature death.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.620
There are individuals
with conditions

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.560
like Zollinger-Ellison syndrome
stricken with tumors

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.840
that can cause
excess stomach acid secretion,

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.600
for whom the risk versus benefit
of long-term use

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.880
may be acceptable,
but that's a far cry

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.940
from the 100 million PPIs
prescribed annually

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.440
in the United States alone.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:26.040
To deal with acid reflux
without drugs,

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.960
recommendations include
weight loss,

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.220
smoking cessation,

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.260
avoiding fatty meals,

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.080
especially within
two to three hours of bedtime,

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.260
increased fiber consumption,

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.540
and, overall,
a more plant-based diet,

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:42.600
because non-vegetarianism
is associated with

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.900
twice the odds of acid reflux-
induced inflammation.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:48.840
Other classes of drugs
that have been associated

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.480
with hip fracture risk
include antidepressants,

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.060
anti-Parkinson's drugs,
antipsychotics,

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.380
anti-anxiety drugs,

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.120
oral corticosteroids,

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.280
and the other major class
of heartburn drugs,

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.200
the H2 blockers, such as Pepcid,

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:04.020
Zantac, Tagamet, and Axid.

